 digit (20) of 21: 11*20 = 220.\nThen add them together: 11 + 220 = 231. \n\nThat matches what I had before. I think that's correct. Let me check once more with direct multiplication. 11 times 21. \n\nMultiplying 11 by 21:\n\n   21\nx 11\n-----\n   21  (21 x 1)\n+210  (21 x 10)\n-----\n 231\n\nYes, that's the same result. So the answer should be 231.\n"]
