re there are no calculation errors. 26\u00d75: 25\u00d75=125, plus 1\u00d75=5, so 130. Correct. 26\u00d740: 26\u00d74=104, add a zero gives 1040. Yep. Sum is 130+1040=1170. All checks out.\n</think>\n\n",
