s 1360, plus 18 is 1378. Same result. Okay, so that's correct.\n\nTherefore, the answer should be 1378. Let me just make sure that I followed the template exactly. The user specified to break it down into steps for each digit, so since 53 has two digits, two steps. The first step was 26*3=78, second step 26*50=1300. Sum those gives 1378. Yep, that's all good. No mistakes here.\n</think>\n\n",
