em: 168 + 1440 = 1608. Yep, same answer.\n\nI think that's right. Let me just confirm with another method, maybe using the distributive property differently. 24*67 can also be thought of as (20 +4)*(60+7). Expanding that: 20*60 + 20*7 +4*60 +4*7. \n\nCalculating each term:\n20*60 = 1200\n20*7 =140\n4*60=240\n4*7=28\n\nAdding all those: 1200 +140 is 1340, plus 240 is 1580, plus 28 is 1608. Same result again. Okay, so that's solid. \n\nSo the steps as per the template: first multiply 24 by 7 (the ones place), then 24 by 60 (the tens place), add them together. The sum is 1608. So the final answer should be 1608.\n"]  7%|▋         | 37/500 [20:27<4:17:56, 33.43s/it]  8%|▊         | 38/500 [21:04<4:27:14, 34.71s/it]
