2  (53 x4)\n+1060  (53x20, shifted one position to the left)\n-----\n 1272\n\nYep, that's right. So all steps check out. I think that's solid. The reasoning follows the template's structure, breaking it into the two steps for each digit, considering their place values, then summing. Looks good!\n"]  8%|▊         | 41/500 [22:50<4:16:33, 33.54s/it]  8%|▊         | 42/500 [23:17<4:01:27, 31.63s/it]
