aybe do a quick check using estimation. 90 times 40 is 3600, and 91 is a bit more, 41 is a bit more, so 3600 plus some. 3731 is reasonable. Alternatively, 91*40 would be 3640, plus another 91 gives 3731. Yep, that's correct.\n"] 10%|█         | 50/500 [28:28<4:55:35, 39.41s/it] 10%|█         | 51/500 [28:51<4:17:48, 34.45s/it]
