 each term:\n30*90 = 2700\n30*3 = 90\n6*90 = 540\n6*3 = 18\n\nAdding them all up: 2700 + 90 is 2790, plus 540 is 3330, plus 18 is 3348. Same answer again. Okay, that seems consistent. \n\nI think that's right. So the product of 36 and 93 is 3348.\n"]
