s the same as 67*7*10. 67*7 is 469, times 10 is 4690. Either way, the answer should be 4690. I think that's correct. Let me confirm with another method. \n\nIf I do 67*70, I can also think of 70 as 70, so 60*70 = 4200 and 7*70=490. Adding those gives 4200 + 490 = 4690. Yep, that matches. Okay, I'm confident now.\n"]
