ce) to get 248.\n\n2. Multiply 31 by 70 (the tens place, which is 7*10) to get 2170.\n\nThen sum 248 +2170 =2418. Therefore the final answer is 2418.\n\nI think that's all. Let me make sure I didn't make any arithmetic errors. Let's check 31*78 another way. Maybe 30*78 = 2340, then add 1*78 which is 78. So 2340 +78 =2418. Yep, same result. Okay, confident now.\n</think>\n\n",
