uld be 1394. I think that's right. Let me just do a quick estimate to confirm. 17 is close to 20, and 82 is close to 80. 20*80=1600. Since both numbers are a bit less, 1394 is reasonable because it's lower than 1600. That makes sense. So I'm confident the answer is 1394.\n</think>\n\n",
