since 50 is 5*10, so 74*5=370, then add a zero to make it 3700)\n-----\n3700\n\nYep, that works. So the total is 3700. I think that's correct. Let me just do a quick estimation to check. 50 times 70 is 3500, and 50 times 4 is 200, so adding those gives 3700. That's exactly what I have. Okay, so I think that's the right answer. No steps seem missing here. Since 74 only has two digits, there are only two steps, so the reasoning should be straightforward. Alright, confident with that.\n"]
