 first part: 74 x6. 70x6 is 420, 4x6 is24, so 444. That's correct. Then 74x90. 74x9 is indeed 666, so times 10 is 6660. Adding 444 and 6660. 444+6660. Let's see, 6660 + 400 is 7060, plus 44 is 7104. Yeah, that's right. \n\nAlternatively, maybe I can use another method to verify. Let's try the standard multiplication algorithm:\n\n   74\nx 96\n-------\nFirst multiply 74 by 6: 444 (as before)\nThen multiply 74 by 90 (since the 9 is in the tens place, so it's 9*10). So 74*90 = 6660. Then add them together: 444 +6660 =7104. Same result. \n\nAlternatively, maybe using the distributive property: (70 +4)(90 +6) =70*90 +70*6 +4*90 +4*6. Let's compute each term:\n\n70*90 = 6300\n\n70*6 =420\n\n4*90 =360\n\n4*6 =24\n\nAdding all these: 6300 +420 =6720; 6720 +360 =7080; 7080 +24=7104. Yep, same answer. \n\nSo all methods lead to 7104, so I think that's correct. I don't see any mistakes in my steps. Therefore, the product of 74 and 96 is 7104.\n"]
