o 90+4, which is the same as before. Alternatively, maybe 51*(100 -6) = 51*100 -51*6 =5100 -306 = 4794. Let me check that: 5100 minus 300 is 4800, then minus 6 more is 4794. That works too. So all methods lead to the same answer. I think that's solid. So the product should be 4794.\n</think>\n\n",
