40 + 60 = 1100; 1100 + 18 = 1118. Yep, same result. \n\nSo I think the answer is 1118. Let me just confirm with a calculator in my mind. 86 times 10 is 860, plus 86 times 3 is 258, totaling 1118. Yep, that's correct. I don't see any mistakes here.\n</think>\n\n",
