roperty: (50 +4)(40 +7) = 50*40 +50*7 +4*40 +4*7. \n\n50*40 =2000, 50*7=350, 4*40=160, 4*7=28. Adding all together: 2000 +350 =2350, plus 160 is 2510, plus 28 is 2538. Yep, same result. Okay, so that's correct. So the final answer is 2538.\n</think>\n\n",
