ple, they mentioned "the tens place digit 50 of number2 153". So for 22, the tens place digit is 2, but represented as 20. So the second step would be multiplying 50 by 20. That\'s correct. \n\nAlright, I think that\'s all. Let me put it into the template format properly.\n']
