e 7719. Let me just verify using another method to be sure. Maybe the standard algorithm:\n\n   93\nx 83\n-------\nFirst multiply 93 by 3: 279\n\nThen multiply 93 by 80 (shifted one position to the left):\n\n93 x 80 = 7440\n\nAdding them together: 279 + 7440 = 7719. Yep, same result. Okay, that seems right. I think that's the correct answer.\n</think>\n\n",
