0 -80 -7 = 1600+140 is 1740, minus 80 is 1660, minus 7 is 1653. Yep, same result. Okay, so that's correct.\n\nSo the steps are as per the template. The first step is multiplying by the ones digit (7), the second by the tens digit (80), then adding. The answer is 1653. Alright, that should be the correct process.\n</think>\n\n",
