6\nThen multiply 97 by 70 (so shift one position to the left):\n97 x70 = 6790\nAdd them: 776 + 6790 = 7566. \n\nAlternatively, maybe do it another way to confirm. Let's see, 97 times 78. Maybe use distributive property: (100 - 3) * 78 = 100*78 - 3*78 = 7800 - 234 = 7566. Oh, that works too. So that confirms the answer is 7566. Okay, so the steps are correct.\n"] 87%|████████▋ | 437/500 [4:02:00<33:06, 31.53s/it] 88%|████████▊ | 438/500 [4:02:24<30:20, 29.36s/it]
