o that confirms it. \n\nHmm, so all methods lead to 784. I think that's the correct answer then. I don't see any mistakes in my calculations. Let me just check once more with the standard algorithm:\n\n   16\nx49\n------\n  144 (16x9)\n+640 (16x40, written as 640 shifted one left)\n------\n 784\n\nYes, adding 144 and 640 gives 784. Okay, confident now.\n"]
