400, so subtract 20 and add 1? Wait, (20-1)^2 = 400 -40 +1 = 361. Yeah that checks out. So the answer should be 361. Let me verify again with the steps. \n\nFirst step: 19*9 = 171. Second step: 19*10 = 190. 171+190 = 361. Correct. Okay, so that's the process.\n</think>\n\n",
