 values. 30 times 70 is 2100, and 32 is a bit more, 77 is a bit more, so the total should be a bit more than 2100. 2464 is 364 more, which sounds reasonable. Alternatively, 32*70=2240, plus 32*7=224, so total is indeed 2240+224=2464. Okay, confident now.\n</think>\n\n",
