 standard algorithm:\n\n   67\nx 38\n-------\nFirst multiply 67 by 8: 536\nThen multiply 67 by 30 (shift one position to the left):\n   67\nx 30\n-----\n2010\n\nAdding 536 + 2010 gives 2546. Yep, same result. Alright, confident that's correct.\n"] 91%|█████████ | 454/500 [4:11:53<26:28, 34.53s/it] 91%|█████████ | 455/500 [4:12:29<26:08, 34.86s/it]
