's correct. Let me just do a quick estimate to be sure. 93 is close to 90, and 58 is close to 60. 90*60 is 5400. Since we rounded both numbers up, the actual product should be a bit less than 5400. 5394 is indeed 6 less, which makes sense. So that seems right.\n</think>\n\n",
