t do the multiplication straight out again. 67 times 31. Let's do it vertically again:\n\n       67\n     × 31\n     -----\n        67  (this is 67×1)\n      201   (this is 67×30, shifted one position to the left)\n     -----\n      2077\n\nYes, adding 67 and 2010 (since 201 shifted left is 2010) gives 2077. Alright, that's consistent. I think that's the right answer then.\n"] 92%|█████████▏| 460/500 [4:15:36<24:15, 36.38s/it] 92%|█████████▏| 461/500 [4:15:58<20:48, 32.02s/it]
