them gives 261 + 3,480 = 3,741. \n\nAlternatively, using the distributive property: (80 + 7)(40 + 3) = 80*40 + 80*3 + 7*40 + 7*3. Let's calculate each term:\n\n80*40 = 3,200\n\n80*3 = 240\n\n7*40 = 280\n\n7*3 = 21\n\nAdding all these: 3,200 + 240 = 3,440; 3,440 + 280 = 3,720; 3,720 +21=3,741. Yep, same result. Okay, that seems consistent. I think that's the correct answer then.\n"]
