 +210=5110. Yes, that also gives the same result. \n\nSo all methods lead to 5110. Therefore, the answer should be 5110. Let me just ensure I didn't make any arithmetic errors. \n\nFirst method step-by-step:\n\n73 ×0 =0\n\n73 ×70 = 73×7×10=511×10=5110. Total is 0 +5110=5110.\n\nSecond method: 73×7=511, then ×10 gives 5110.\n\nThird method: (70+3)×70=70×70=4900 plus 3×70=210, totaling 5110. \n\nAll correct. So the final answer is 5110.\n"]
